Media 201to [B] Marine Recorder survey: MRCCW80000000003\tInternal Custodian: Kirsten Ramsay, Team Leader, Marine \u0026amp; Coastal Ecosystems Team Metadata contact: Data Services, NRW.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\tUnknown\tEditable\t2025-02-04T11:13:50.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\tMEDIN\tPublic record\n18178\tNRW_DS116233\tFlood Defences without Standardised Attributes (archived data)\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313136323333\tX:\\Flood Risk\\Flood Risk Management\\Floodmap Flood Defences without attributes.lyr Stored in AMX but made available On the Y drive\tMark Pugh, Principal Advisor, Flood Risk Analysis Group, FIRM\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\tOpen Government Licence\tValid\tNon-editable\t2025-02-04T10:38:20.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\tGEMINI\tPublic record\n18252\tNRW_DS116284\tFelling Licence Applications\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313136323834\tX:\\Licensing and Permitting\\Felling Licences\\Felling Licence Applications.lyr\tCustodian: Keith Harri Jones, GIS and Spatial Services Team\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\tOpen Government Licence\tValid\tEditable\t2025-02-24T12:22:36.000Z\tRachel Morris\tGEMINI\tPublic record\n18982\tNRW_DS125080\tNRW Local Model Manager\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313235303830\tGIS Corporate Data Store X:\\Flood Risk\\Flood Risk Management\tInternal Data Custodian(s): Mark Pugh (Flood Risk Analysis)  Metadata Point of Contact:  Simon James, Dave Tarrant (Flood Risk Analysis)\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\tValid\tEditable\t2025-02-04T10:17:06.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\tGEMINI\tPublic record\n17465\tNRW_DS99459\tAll Wales Phase 1 Terrestrial - Scattered Vegetation Layer\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-3939343539\tX:\\Biological\\Phase 1 Habitat Mapping\\Phase 1Terrestrial\\Original Phase 1\\Phase1 Scattered.lyr ,  Legacy CCW Archive M:\\phase_1\\allwales_ph1\\p1colour_sca.tab\tInternal Contact: Jonathon Rothwell Specialist Advisor: Terrestrial Habitat and Resilience Mapping. Terrestrial Ecosystems Team.     Metadata Contact: Geospatial Team, NRW\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\tOpen Government Licence\tValid\tEditable\t2025-02-04T09:07:22.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n17593\tNRW_DS109024\tAmphibians and Reptiles Licence Return Data  (2001 - 2008)\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313039303234\tRecorder 6 CCW0007200000002 Amphibian \u0026amp; Reptile Licence Return Data\tInternal Custodian:  Species Protection Team, Maes y Ffynnon/Ffynnon DRMS.  Metadata Contact: Master Reference Data Team, NRW / Data Services Team, NRW\tVarious including volunteer recorders-Natural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\tUnknown\tEditable\t2025-02-04T12:13:47.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n18221\tNRW_DS116250\tReservoir Flood Map Maximum Flood Outline Extent\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313136323530\tX:\\Flood Risk\\Flood Risk Management\\Reservoir Maximum Flood Extent.lyr\tData custodian - Phillip Morgan, Team Leader, Reservoir Regulation\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\tNRW Conditional\tValid\tEditable\t2025-02-12T14:13:15.657Z\tRachel Morris\tGEMINI\tPublic record\n18471\tNRW_DS120116\tRiver Wye Special Area of Conservation (SAC) Lamprey Species Survey 2013 – 2015\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313230313136\tKiECO database (WISKI)  Some data is also available on the DMS: https://cyfoethnaturiolcymru.sharepoint.com/sites/smar/fm/Running%20Waters%20Habitats%20Directive%20Data%20Cycle%203/Forms/NRW%20View.aspx?RootFolder\u003d%2Fsites%2Fsmar%2Ffm%2FRunning%20Waters%20Habitats%20Directive%20Data%20Cycle%203%2FWye%20Lamprey\u0026amp;FolderCTID\u003d0x012000EE02D3CE2ED1AE4085983FEDF88CC2E5\u0026amp;View\u003d%7B90B85581%2DA33A%2D4F0D%2DB9D4%2DBCB28FC39C08%7D\tSophie Gott, Fisheries Technical Specialist, NRW Heather Garrett, Freshwater Monitoring Co-ordinator, NRW\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\tUnknown\tEditable\t2025-02-04T12:13:38.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n17835\tNRW_DS111182\tIntertidal Monitoring of Pectenogammarus planicrurus in Pen Llyn a\u0027r Sarnau Special Area of Conservation (