.lyr\tContact:  Quentin Grimely Access Delivery Team, Sustainable Communities Gruffudd Owen, Wales Coast Path Officer (North)       The data is overwritten as it is updated along the path - so start date may not relfect the date on the dataset.  Natural Resources Wales (NRW) grant fund Local Authorities to collect this data. They input the data into the CAMs system which is hosted. NRW then collate the data on behalf of the grant funded local authorities and supply it back to them as a whole dataset via a Web Mapping Service.  At the moment we arent clear over the ownership of the data, becuase it is grant aided we think that the data is owned by the council but then given to NRW for use.\t\t\tUnknown\tNon-editable\t2025-02-04T12:39:26.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n18047\tNRW_DS115165\tMarine Habitat Vulnerability Assessment of the Welsh Coast - Phase 1\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313135313635\tX:\\Biological\\Marine Habitat\\Marine habitat vulnerability.lyr   Archived as project 378, media 1389 (K:\\Archive\\Media\\Media 1301-1400\\Media 1389. The database is held in Z:\\Archive\\CCW_H_Drive\\Science\\MFSG\\Projects\\Ph1sites\\Intertidal Site Assessments\\Intertidal Site Assessment Contract\\ExeGesIS Products\\Assessment Database V10 The database is called: IntertidalPhase1Analysisv10.mde In this folder on the Z:\\ drive are also ArcGIS format maps covering the assessments of biotopes and units, and also summary report tables.\tPaul Brazier, Senior Marine Environmental Assessment Officer, Marine Environmental Assessment \u0026amp; Advice Team Metadata contact: Data Services, NRW\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\tUnknown\tEditable\t2025-02-04T11:49:56.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\tMEDIN\tPublic record\n17466\tNRW_DS99503\tBiodiversity Action Plan (BAP) Marsh Fritillary (Euphydryas aurinia) in Wales\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-3939353033\tX:\\Biological\\Species sourced by NRW\\Terrestial\\Invertebrates\\Insects  (multiple datasets held under this file)\t