   \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#CY\"\u003eGwaith monitro rhynglanwol ar Pectenogammarus planicrurus yn ACA Pen Llyn a\u0027r Sarnau yn 2007\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:title\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2009 CCW / ASML Pen Llyn a\u0027r Sarnau SAC Pectenogammarus planicrurus monitoring MRCCW1630000001D\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2008 CCW / ASML Pen Llyn a\u0027r Sarnau SAC Pectenogammarus planicrurus monitoring MRCCW16300000011\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2007 CCW/ASML Pen Llyn a\u0027r Sarnau SAC Pectenogammarus planicrurus monitoring MRCCW3000000004A\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e2009-03-31\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003cgmd:code\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eNRW_DS111182\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:code\u003e             \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e           \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e       \u003c/gmd:citation\u003e       \u003cgmd:abstract xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003ePectenogammarus planicrurus is the only amphipod which is a permanent resident of shingle beaches and it was found on the steep gravel or pebble beach fronting the promenade at Pwllheli during Phase 1 surveys undertaken by Countryside Council for Wales (CCW) during June 1996.  This dataset contains the results of a survey carried out in 2007 to investigate whether P. planicrurus was still present in the area.  Monitoring of this feature is ongoing and is repeated on a yearly basis.   The purpose of this data capture is to confirm the continued presence and monitor the population of this scarce amphipod species at Pwllheli, repeating work carried out in 2004.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003ePectenogammarus planicrurus is the only amphipod which is a permanent resident of shingle beaches and it was found on the steep gravel or pebble beach fronting the promenade at Pwllheli during Phase 1 surveys undertaken by Countryside Council for Wales (CCW) during June 1996.  This dataset contains the results of a survey carried out in 2007 to investigate whether P. planicrurus was still present in the area.  Monitoring of this feature is ongoing and is repeated on a yearly basis.   The purpose of this data capture is to confirm the continued presence and monitor the population of this scarce amphipod species at Pwllheli, repeating work carried out in 2004.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e         \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e       \u003c/gmd:abstract\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e           \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\u003c/gco: