eographicIdentifier\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_GeographicDescription\u003e           \u003c/gmd:geographicElement\u003e           \u003cgmd:temporalElement\u003e             \u003cgmd:EX_TemporalExtent\u003e               \u003cgmd:extent\u003e                 \u003cgml:TimePeriod gml:id\u003d\"_6e2253ac-8aaa-4e47-a59b-cf39911f8dad\"\u003e                   \u003cgml:beginPosition\u003e2007-08-31\u003c/gml:beginPosition\u003e                   \u003cgml:endPosition\u003e2011-07-24\u003c/gml:endPosition\u003e                 \u003c/gml:TimePeriod\u003e               \u003c/gmd:extent\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_TemporalExtent\u003e           \u003c/gmd:temporalElement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:EX_Extent\u003e       \u003c/gmd:extent\u003e       \u003cgmd:supplementalInformation\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eMercer, T.S. 2013. Intertidal SAC monitoring, Pen Llyn a’r Sarnau SAC July 2012. CCW Marine Monitoring Report No: 102, pp 68 + x, Aquatic Survey \u0026amp; Monitoring Ltd. Bollihope, Co. Durham.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e       \u003c/gmd:supplementalInformation\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e   \u003c/gmd:identificationInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:contentInfo\u003e     \u003cnrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e       \u003cnrw:internalInfo\u003e         \u003cnrw:MD_InternalInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eData is archived within the Marine Archive as Project No. 199, Media No. 554 and Project 410. Media No. 1430.  Marine Monitoring data for each year is also organised in legacy drives  Z:\\Archive\\Legacy\\CCW_H_DRIVE\\Science\\MFSG\\Marine_Habitats_and_Species\\Marine Monitoring\\Intid PLAS\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalContactInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eInternal Custodian: Paul Brazier, Senior Specialist, Marine Environmental Assessment Officer, Marine Monitoring, Assessment \u0026amp; Reporting\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalContactInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:relatedTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eAcross Wales intertidal SAC monitoring Pen Llyn a\u0027r Sarnau SAC : August 2008\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:relatedTitle\u003e           \u003cnrw:relatedTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eAcross Wales intertidal SAC monitoring Pen Llyn a\u0027r Sarnau SAC July 2009\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:relatedTitle\u003e           \u003cnrw:relatedTitle xmlns:gn\u003d\"http://www.fao.org/geonetwork\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eIntertidal SAC monitoring Pen Llyn a\u0027r Sarnau SAC July 2012\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:relatedTitle\u003e         \u003c/nrw:MD_InternalInfo\u003e       \u003c/nrw:internalInfo\u003e     \u003c/nrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e   \u003c/gmd:contentInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:distributionInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_Distribution\u003e       \u003cgmd:distributionFormat\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_Format\u003e           \u003cgmd:name\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/M01/current/DOC\"\u003eDocuments\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:name\u003e           \u003cgmd:version gco:nilReason\u003d\"unknown\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:version\u003e           \u003cgmd:specification\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e[A] Digital versions of the contract report: Microsoft Word document(s); and an equivalent Adobe Portable Document Format version [B] Excel Spreadsheets of data: - Dyfi Marine Recorder Spp Data 2007 V4.xls - HEBOG1730_Dyfi_ infauna_2007.xls [C] A series of MapInfo GIS layers in MapInfo Native format (Tables).Translations from the MapInfo Tables are retained in ESRI Shapefile and MapInfo Interchange formats.: [D] Marine Recorder files: MRCCW3000000004A [E] Photographs of the site, sediment characteristics, core contents and quadrats.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_Format\u003e       \u003c/gmd:distributionFormat\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_Distribution\u003e   \u003c/gmd:distributionInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e       \u003cgmd:scope\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_Scope\u003e           \u003cgmd:level\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:level\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_Scope\u003e       \u003c/gmd:scope\u003e       \u003cgmd:report\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e           \u003cgmd:result\u003e             \u003cgmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e               \u003cgmd:specification\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e                   \u003cgmd:title\u003e                     \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2010/1089\"\u003eCommission Regulation (EU) No 1089/2010 of 23 November 2010 implementing Directive 2007/2/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council as regards interoperability of spatial data sets and services\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:title\u003e                   \u003cgmd:date\u003e                     \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:date\u003e                         \u003cgco:Date\u003e2010-12-08\u003c/gco:Date\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                         \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e                     \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e               \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e               \u003cgmd:explanation\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis dataset has not been assessed for conformance to the referenced INSPIRE regulation.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:explanation\u003e               \u003cgmd:pass\u003e                 \u003cgco:Boolean\u003efalse\u003c/gco:Boolean\u003e               \u003c/gmd:pass\u003e             \u003c/gmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e           \u003c/gmd:result\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e       \u003c/gmd:report\u003e       \u003cgmd:lineage\u003e         \u003cgmd:LI_Lineage\u003e           \u003cgmd:statement xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eA visit was made to a site in lower shore shingle at Marian-y-de, Pwllheli where populations of the amphipods were known to be present to determine whether or not they were still present. The species is found by finding the appropriate habitat, making a small pool of water in the shingle and then looking for amphipods swimming in the water. This was done at irregular intervals along the shore.  The survey is repeated regularly.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eA visit was made to a site in lower shore shingle at Marian-y-de, Pwllheli where populations of the amphipods were known to be present to determine whether or not they were still present. The species is found by finding the appropriate habitat, making a small pool of water in the shingle and then looking for amphipods swimming in the water. This was done at irregular intervals along the shore.  The survey is repeated regularly.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:statement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:LI_Lineage\u003e       \u003c/gmd:lineage\u003e     \u003c/gmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e   \u003c/gmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e \u003c/gmd:MD_Metadata\u003e\n"
          }
        ]
      },
