65\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:eastBoundLongitude\u003e               \u003cgmd:southBoundLatitude\u003e                 \u003cgco:Decimal\u003e51.240829\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:southBoundLatitude\u003e               \u003cgmd:northBoundLatitude\u003e                 \u003cgco:Decimal\u003e53.513067\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:northBoundLatitude\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_GeographicBoundingBox\u003e           \u003c/gmd:geographicElement\u003e           \u003cgmd:temporalElement\u003e             \u003cgmd:EX_TemporalExtent\u003e               \u003cgmd:extent\u003e                 \u003cgml:TimePeriod gml:id\u003d\"_4206417c-c414-48fb-b252-73ae3102bae8\"\u003e                   \u003cgml:beginPosition\u003e2006-08-01\u003c/gml:beginPosition\u003e                   \u003cgml:endPosition\u003e2008-05-31\u003c/gml:endPosition\u003e                 \u003c/gml:TimePeriod\u003e               \u003c/gmd:extent\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_TemporalExtent\u003e           \u003c/gmd:temporalElement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:EX_Extent\u003e       \u003c/gmd:extent\u003e       \u003cgmd:supplementalInformation\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eAn accompanying report is available: Halcrow Group Limited., 2004. Coastal Risk Assessment Phase One Report October 2004. National Trust\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e       \u003c/gmd:supplementalInformation\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e   \u003c/gmd:identificationInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:contentInfo\u003e     \u003cnrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e       \u003cnrw:internalInfo\u003e         \u003cnrw:MD_InternalInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eWelsh Subset of the data, and the report are held on the MFSG shared drive (File path: Z:\\Archive\\Legacy\\CCW_H_DRIVE\\Science\\MFSG\\Estuarine \u0026amp; Coastal Science\\NT_Coastal Risk Ass_Oct04   For full database please contact the National Trust.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalContactInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eGIS Service Desk  Internal Custodian – Nicola Rimington, Lead Specialist Advisor, Marine and Coastal Physical Processes and Coastal Management, Marine and Coastal Policy \u0026amp; Planning Team External Custodian: Coast and Marine Support, The National Trust. (also contact: Adrian Woodhall adrianwoodhall@btinternet.com)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalContactInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:relatedTitle gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e           \u003c/nrw:relatedTitle\u003e         \u003c/nrw:MD_InternalInfo\u003e       \u003c/nrw:internalInfo\u003e     \u003c/nrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e   \u003c/gmd:contentInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:distributionInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_Distribution\u003e       \u003cgmd:distributionFormat\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_Format\u003e           \u003cgmd:name\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/M01/current/DOC\"\u003eDocuments\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:name\u003e           \u003cgmd:version gco:nilReason\u003d\"unknown\" /\u003e           \u003cgmd:specification\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e[A] Excel Spreadsheet at NRW. [B] Original data at the National Trust is held in GIS (MapInfo).\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_Format\u003e       \u003c/gmd:distributionFormat\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_Distribution\u003e   \u003c/gmd:distributionInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e       \u003cgmd:scope\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_Scope\u003e           \u003cgmd:level\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:level\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_Scope\u003e       \u003c/gmd:scope\u003e       \u003cgmd:report\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e           \u003cgmd:result\u003e             \u003cgmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e               \u003cgmd:specification\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e                   \u003cgmd:title\u003e                     \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2010/1089\"\u003eCommission Regulation (EU) No 1089/2010 of 23 November 2010 implementing Directive 2007/2/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council as regards interoperability of spatial data sets and services\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:title\u003e                   \u003cgmd:date\u003e                     \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:date\u003e                         \u003cgco:Date\u003e2010-12-08\u003c/gco:Date\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                         \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e                     \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e               \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e               \u003cgmd:explanation\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis dataset has not been assessed for conformance to the referenced INSPIRE regulation.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:explanation\u003e               \u003cgmd:pass\u003e                 \u003cgco:Boolean\u003efalse\u003c/gco:Boolean\u003e               \u003c/gmd:pass\u003e             \u003c/gmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e           \u003c/gmd:result\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e       \u003c/gmd:report\u003e       \u003cgmd:lineage\u003e         \u003cgmd:LI_Lineage\u003e           \u003cgmd:statement xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eNational Trust properties that are considered to be in the flood zone or coastal erosion zone were identified using Environment Agency (EA) Flood data and National flood Risk Assessment data as a basis.  These are mapped in GIS and properties at risk from flooding were identified by eye. These will be updated in the near future by electronic methods. The database contains information for the whole of the UK, CCW only has and is using a subset of the data in spreadsheet format. Electronic maps are available from the National Trust.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eNational Trust properties that are considered to be in the flood zone or coastal erosion zone were identified using Environment Agency (EA) Flood data and National flood Risk Assessment data as a basis.  These are mapped in GIS and properties at risk from flooding were identified by eye. These will be updated in the near future by electronic methods. The database contains information for the whole of the UK, CCW only has and is using a subset of the data in spreadsheet format. Electronic maps are available from the National Trust.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:statement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:LI_Lineage\u003e       \u003c/gmd:lineage\u003e     \u003c/gmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e   \u003c/gmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e \u003c/gmd:MD_Metadata\u003e\tUnknown\tEditable\t2025-02-04T11:49:14.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n17099\tEXT_DS110030\tEnvironment Agency (EA): Catalogue of Light Detection and Ranging (LIDAR) Coverage (3rd Party Data)\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313130303330\t\tGIS and Spatial Data Team, NRW\t\u003cgmd:MD_Metadata xmlns:gmd\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmd\" xmlns:xsi\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xmlns:gco\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gco\" xmlns:srv\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/srv\" xmlns:gmx\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmx\" xmlns:gts\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gts\" xmlns:gsr\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gsr\" xmlns:gmi\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmi\" xmlns:gss\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gss\" xmlns:nrw\u003d\"http://naturalresources.wales/nrw\" xmlns:gml\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/gml/3.2\" xmlns:xlink\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"\u003e   \u003cgmd:fileIdentifier\u003e     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313130303330\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e   \u003c/gmd:fileIdentifier\u003e   \u003cgmd:language\u003e     \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\"\u003eEnglish\u003c/gmd:LanguageCode\u003e   \u003c/gmd:language\u003e   \u003cgmd:hierarchyLevel\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e   \u003c/gmd:hierarchyLevel\u003e   \u003cgmd:contact\u003e     \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e       \u003cgmd:organisationName gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e       \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e           \u003cgmd:address\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e               \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e               \u003cgmd:electronicMailAddress gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e                 \u003cg