        \u003cgmd:MD_CharacterSetCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_CharacterSetCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"utf8\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:characterEncoding\u003e     \u003c/gmd:PT_Locale\u003e   \u003c/gmd:locale\u003e   \u003cgmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e       \u003cgmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e         \u003cgmd:RS_Identifier\u003e           \u003cgmd:code\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/27700\"\u003eBritish National Grid (EPSG::27700)\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:code\u003e         \u003c/gmd:RS_Identifier\u003e       \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e   \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:identificationInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e       \u003cgmd:citation\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e           \u003cgmd:title xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eEnvironment Agency (EA): Catalogue of Light Detection and Ranging (LIDAR) Coverage (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eEnvironment Agency (EA): Catalogue of Light Detection and Ranging (LIDAR) Coverage (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:title\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eCatalog Asiantaeth yr Amgylchedd o\u0027r mannau a fesurwyd gyda LIDAR Gorffennaf 2006\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003cgmd:code\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eEXT_DS110030\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:code\u003e             \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e           \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e       \u003c/gmd:citation\u003e       \u003cgmd:abstract xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eLight Detection and Ranging (LIDAR) is an airborne mapping technique. The Environment Agency\u0027s LIDAR data archive contains digital elevation data derived from surveys carried out by the Environment Agency and represents over 10 years of survey work carried out by a specialist remote sensing team based in Bath and Coventry. Depending on the area, data is available at 25cm, 50cm, 1m and 2m resolution which can be supplied as a Digital Surface Model (includes heights of objects, such as vehicles, buildings and vegetation as well as terrain surfaces) and a Digital Terrain Model (a \\bare earth model\\\" with surface objects filtered out of the DSM by applying bespoke software techniques). The purpose of this data capture was to produce accurate elevation data and highly detailed digital surface and terrain models.\"\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eLight Detection and Ranging (LIDAR) is an airborne mapping technique. The Environment Agency\u0027s LIDAR data archive contains digital elevation data derived from surveys carried out by the Environment Agency and represents over 10 years of survey work carried out by a specialist remote sensing team based in Bath and Coventry. Depending on the area, data is available at 25cm, 50cm, 1m and 2m resolution which can be supplied as a Digital Surface Model (includes heights of objects, such as vehicles, buildings and vegetation as well as terrain surfaces) and a Digital Terrain Model (a \\bare earth model\\\" with surface objects filtered out of the DSM by applying bespoke software techniques). The purpose of this data capture was to produce accurate elevation data and highly detailed digital surface and terrain models.\"\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e         \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e       \u003c/gmd:abstract\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e           \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eEnvironment Agency (EA)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e           \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e               \u003cgmd:address\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e                   \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eMillbank Tower, 25th Floor, 21//24 Millbank, London, SW1P 4XL, England\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                   \u003cgmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eenquiries@environment-agency.gov.uk\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Address\u003e               \u003c/gmd:address\u003e               \u003cgmd:onlineResource\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e                   \u003cgmd:linkage\u003e                     \u003cgmd:URL\u003ehttp://www.environment-agency.gov.uk/\u003c/gmd:URL\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:linkage\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e               \u003c/gmd:onlineResource\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Contact\u003e           \u003c/gmd:contactInfo\u003e           \u003cgmd:role\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_RoleCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_RoleCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"owner\" /