eSeasearch Marine Surveys in Wales 1995 onwards (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eSeasearch Marine Surveys in Wales 1995 onwards (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:title\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e1998 Seasearch survey of Stackpole, South Pembrokeshire, Wales MRCCW20000000004\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2000 Seasearch Survey of Mid Wales MRCCW20000000005\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2000 Seasearch Survey of Ramsey Island, Pembrokeshire, Wales MRCCW30000000007\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e1995 - 2001 Seasearch Survey of North Anglesey, North Wales MRCCW3000000000D\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2002 Seasearch Survey of Llyn Peninsula, North Wales MRCCW3000000000F\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2002 Seasearch Survey of East Anglesey, North Wales MRCCW30000000013\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2001 Seasearch Newbrough Seagrass Search, Menai Strait, North Wales MRCCW30000000017\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2001 Seasearch Survey of Criccieth, North Wales MRCCW3000000001B\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e1999 Seasearch Survey of Daugleddau Estuary, Wales MRCCW3000000001D\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2002 Seasearch Survey of Skokholm Island, Pembrokeshire, Wales MRCCW30000000020\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2002 Seasearch North Wales Seafan Survey MRCCW30000000022\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2000-2002 Seasearch Surveys of the Menai Strait, North Wales MRCCW30000000028\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2003 Seasearch South Llyn survey, North Wales MRCCW1100000002F\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eWelsh Seasearch Surveys from 1995 onwards\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eArolygon Seasearch Cymru o 1995 ymlaen\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e2013-04-08\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003cgmd:code\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eEXT_DS110041\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:code\u003e             \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e           \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e       \u003c/gmd:citation\u003e       \u003cgmd:abstract xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eSeasearch is a national project for volunteer sports divers who have an interest in what they\u0027re seeing under water, want to learn more and want to help protect the marine environment around the coasts of Britain and Ireland. This dataset contains the results of a number of Seasearch surveys carried out around the coast of Wales from 1995.  A snapshot of the SeaSearch data is merged with the NRW Marine Recorder snapshot. The main aim is to map out the various types of sea bed found in the near-shore zone. The data collected is also used to fill gaps in our knowledge about what lives where, what affect human activities are having on marine life and to help advise government and policy makers on actions needed to protect the marine wildlife and habitats e.g. by identifying sites where better protection may be needed.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eSeasearch is a national project for volunteer sports divers who have an interest in what they\u0027re seeing under water, want to learn more and want to help protect the marine environment around the coasts of Britain and Ireland. This dataset contains the results of a number of Seasearch surveys carried out around the coast of Wales from 1995.  A snapshot of the SeaSearch data is merged with the NRW Marine Recorder snapshot. The main aim is to map out the various types of sea bed found in the near-shore zone. The data collected is also used to fill gaps in our knowledge about what lives where, what affect human activities are having on marine life and to help advise government and policy makers on actions needed to protect the marine wildlife and habitats e.g. by identifying sites where better protection may be needed.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e         \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e       \u003c/gmd:abstract\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e           \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e           \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e               \u003cgmd:address\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e                   \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eMaes-y-Ffynnon, Penrhosgarnedd, Bangor, Gwynedd, LL57 2DW, Wales\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                   \u003cgmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eenquiries@naturalresourceswales.gov.uk\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Address\u003e               \u003c/gmd:address\u003e               \u003cgmd:onlineResource\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e                   \u003cgmd:linka