temIdentifier\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e   \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:identificationInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e       \u003cgmd:citation\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e           \u003cgmd:title xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eLittoral Hard Substrata of the Menai Strait (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eLittoral Hard Substrata of the Menai Strait (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:title\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eIs-haenau caled rhynglanwol Y Fenai\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e1983-08-31\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003cgmd:code\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eEXT_DS111151\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:code\u003e             \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e           \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e       \u003c/gmd:citation\u003e       \u003cgmd:abstract xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis survey was undertaken as part of a general study of the Menai Strait, commissioned by JNCC, required to assist in decisions related to its designation as one of Britain\u0027s Marine Nature Reserves. Parallel surveys of the soft substrata and sublittoral hard substrata have also been conducted. The dataset includes detailed descriptions of the flora and fauna found on the littoral hard substrate of the Menai Strait, detailed site descriptions (including geological and topographical information and notes on special interest, access and pressures) and flora and faunal lists covering all substrata in the straits. The purpose of this data capture was to provide a topographical and biological description of the Anglesey and Arfon sides of the Menai Strait, concentrating on the hard or, more particularly, stable substrata and the animals and plants which live in these habitats.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eThis survey was undertaken as part of a general study of the Menai Strait, commissioned by JNCC, required to assist in decisions related to its designation as one of Britain\u0027s Marine Nature Reserves. Parallel surveys of the soft substrata and sublittoral hard substrata have also been conducted. The dataset includes detailed descriptions of the flora and fauna found on the littoral hard substrate of the Menai Strait, detailed site descriptions (including geological and topographical information and notes on special interest, access and pressures) and flora and faunal lists covering all substrata in the straits. The purpose of this data capture was to provide a topographical and biological description of the Anglesey and Arfon sides of the Menai Strait, concentrating on the hard or, more particularly, stable substrata and the animals and plants which live in these habitats.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e         \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e       \u003c/gmd:abstract\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e           \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eJoint Nature Conservancy Committee (JNCC)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e           \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e               \u003cgmd:address\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e                   \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eJoint Nature Conservancy Committee (JNCC), Monkstone House, City Road, Peterborough, PE1 1JY\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                   \u003cgmd:electronicMailAddress gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Address\u003e               \u003c/gmd:address\u003e               \u003cgmd:onlineResource\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e                   \u003cgmd:linkage\u003e                     \u003cgmd:URL\u003ehttp://www.jncc.gov.uk\u003c/gmd:URL\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:linkage\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e               \u003c/gmd:onlineResource\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Contact\u003e           \u003c/gmd:contactInfo\u003e           \u003cgmd:role\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_RoleCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_RoleCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"owner\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:role\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e       \u003c/gmd:pointOfContact\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e  