supplied to LERCs by reputable data suppliers. All data are checked before being entered onto the LERCs database.  NRW extract data from the LERCs open feed to update copies held within NRWs GIS.  Updates occur monthly, towards the end of the month\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eData is collated from a range of datasets supplied or digitised by Welsh Local Environmental Records Centres (LERC). Data collated from Protected and Priority species data held by the 4 Welsh LERCs. Data are supplied to LERCs by reputable data suppliers. All data are checked before being entered onto the LERCs database.  NRW extract data from the LERCs open feed to update copies held within NRWs GIS.  Updates occur monthly, towards the end of the month\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:statement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:LI_Lineage\u003e       \u003c/gmd:lineage\u003e     \u003c/gmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e   \u003c/gmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e \u003c/gmd:MD_Metadata\u003e\tUnknown\tEditable\t2025-02-04T10:10:17.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n17100\tEXT_DS111947\tCadw: Historic Parks and Gardens (3rd Party Data)\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313131393437\tX:\\Designations\\CADW\\Historic Parks and Gardens X:\\Designations\\CADW\\Historic Parks and Gardens\\Historic Parks \u0026amp; Gardens - Essential Setting.lyr  X:\\Designations\\CADW\\Historic Parks and Gardens\\Historic Parks and Gardens.lyr  X:\\Designations\\CADW\\Historic Parks and Gardens\\Historic Parks and Gardens - Gardens and Kitchen Gardens.lyr  X:\\Designations\\CADW\\Historic Parks and Gardens\\Historic Parks and Gardens - Significant View.lyr  X:\\Designations\\CADW\\Historic Parks and Gardens\\Historic Parks and Gardens - Walks Seating.lyr   Used to be in the