eted.\u0027\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:otherConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:otherConstraints\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/LimitationsOnPublicAccess/noLimitations\"\u003eno limitations\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:otherConstraints\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_LegalConstraints\u003e       \u003c/gmd:resourceConstraints\u003e       \u003cgmd:resourceConstraints\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_LegalConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:useConstraints\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_RestrictionCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_RestrictionCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"otherRestrictions\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:useConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:otherConstraints\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e© Cadw Data may be re-used under the terms of the Open Government Licence providing it is done so, acknowledging both the source and Cadw\u0027s copyright. It is the recipient\u0027s responsibility to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose. Attribution Statement: Designated Historic Asset GIS Data, The Welsh Historic Environment Service (Cadw), 2018, licensed under the Open Government Licence http://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:otherConstraints\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_LegalConstraints\u003e       \u003c/gmd:resourceConstraints\u003e       \u003cgmd:spatialRepresentationType\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_SpatialRepresentationTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_SpatialRepresentationTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"vector\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:spatialRepresentationType\u003e       \u003cgmd:language\u003e         \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\"\u003eEnglish\u003c/gmd:Lang