      \u003c/gmd:title\u003e                   \u003cgmd:date\u003e                     \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:date\u003e                         \u003cgco:Date\u003e2010-12-08\u003c/gco:Date\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                         \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e                     \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e               \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e               \u003cgmd:explanation\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis dataset has not been assessed for conformance to the referenced INSPIRE regulation.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:explanation\u003e               \u003cgmd:pass\u003e                 \u003cgco:Boolean\u003efalse\u003c/gco:Boolean\u003e               \u003c/gmd:pass\u003e             \u003c/gmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e           \u003c/gmd:result\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e       \u003c/gmd:report\u003e       \u003cgmd:lineage\u003e         \u003cgmd:LI_Lineage\u003e           \u003cgmd:statement xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eOnce all datasets from the Archaeological Trusts are in place the aim is to combine the datasets to create an all-Wales dataset showing all the Historic Landscape Character Areas in all the registered historic landscape areas. The datasets may be updated if the Registers are altered, or areas added to it in future by Cadw.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eOnce all datasets from the Archaeological Trusts are in place the aim is to combine the datasets to create an all-Wales dataset showing all the Historic Landscape Character Areas in all the registered historic landscape areas. The datasets may be updated if the Registers are altered, or areas added to it in future by Cadw.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:statement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:LI_Lineage\u003e       \u003c/gmd:lineage\u003e     \u003c/gmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e   \u003c/gmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e \u003c/gmd:MD_Metadata\u003e\tUnknown\tEditable\t2025-02-04T12:05:00.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n17091\tEXT_DS112468\tMarine Protected Areas (MPAs) Biophysical Data Layer Project (3rd Party Data)\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313132343638\tArchived as Project 271, Media 983 and 1000-1013 (File paths - K:\\Archive\\Media 901to1000\\Media 983,  K:\\Archive\\Media 901to1000\\Media 1000, K:\\Archive\\Media 1001to1100\\Media 1001 etc etc.)  In addition to Related Titles: DCT-10-184068 Distribution of highly mobile species 2010 DCT-12-049886 Spawning and nursery grounds of selected fish species in UK waters 2012. DCT-10-075940 Oceanic thermal fronts from Earth observation data - a potential surrogate for pelagic diversity Summary Document 2010 DCT-10-184095 Development of marine diversity data layer: review of approaches and proposed methods 2009 DCT-10-077540 Residual current flow datalayer: Description of approach 2010 DCT-10-077274 Development of a Benthic Productivity Datalayer: Assessing the available approaches 2009 DCT-10-078178 Benthic productivity data layer development-North Sea Pilot Study 2010\tGIS Service Desk Internal Custodian: Kirsten Ramsay, Team Leader, Marine \u0026amp; Coastal Ecosystems Team (Formerly James Dargie who now works at NatureScot)        See Also: Report No 6, Task 1A. Report No 13, Task 1B. Report No 8, Task 2A. Report No 14, Task 2B. Report No17: Task 2D. Report No 24, Task 2i. Report No 22, Task 3.\t\u003cgmd:MD_Metadata xmlns:gmd\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmd\" xmlns:xsi\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xmlns:gco\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gco\" xmlns:srv\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/srv\" xmlns:gmx\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmx\" xmlns:gts\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gts\" xmlns:gsr\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gsr\" xmlns:gmi\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmi\" xmlns:gss\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gss\" xmlns:nrw\u003d\"http://naturalresources.wales/nrw\" xmlns:gml\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/gml/3.2\" xmlns:xlink\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"\u003e   \u003cgmd:fileIdentifier\u003e     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313132343638\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e   \u003c/gmd:fileIdentifier\u003e   \u003cgmd:language\u003e     \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\"\u003eEnglish\u003c/gmd:LanguageCode\u003e   \u003c/gmd:language\u003e   \u003cgmd:hierarchyLevel\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e   \u003c/gmd:hierarchyLevel\u003e   \u003cgmd:contact\u003e     \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e       \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e       \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e       \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e           \u003cgmd:address\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e               \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eMaes-y-Ffynnon, Penrhosgarnedd, Bangor, Gwynedd, LL57 2DW, Wales\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e               \u003cgmd:electronic