        \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e                 \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e                   \u003cgmd:code\u003e                     \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"https://test.metadata.naturalresources.wales/geonetwork/srv/api/registries/vocabularies/local.theme.converted_nrw-smnr-keywords\"\u003egeonetwork.thesaurus.local.theme.converted_nrw-smnr-keywords\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:code\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e           \u003c/gmd:thesaurusName\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_Keywords\u003e       \u003c/gmd:descriptiveKeywords\u003e       \u003c!-- #1/2 free text --\u003e       \u003c!-- #2/3 medin --\u003e       \u003c!-- #3/4 ipsv --\u003e       \u003c!-- #4/5 NRW SMNR --\u003e       \u003cgmd:resourceConstraints\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_LegalConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:accessConstraints\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_RestrictionCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_RestrictionCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"otherRestrictions\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:accessConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:otherConstraints\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis data is jointly owned by NRW, DEFRA, JNCC and various other recorders. NRW have signed a licence with regards to the access and use of this dataset. Parts of the dataset are restricted, please see individual metadata entries for details. Restricted data layers include: - Bathymetry data layer (SeaZone licence required) - Light penetration layer (SeaZone licence required) - Wave disturbance layer (SeaZone licence required) - Biological zone layers (SeaZone licence required) - BGS habitat layers (BGS licence required) - Modelled BGS habitat communities (BGS licence required) - Deep sea habitat layers (SeaZone licence required) Some layers may only be made available at reduced resolution e.g. sensitive features.  Please refer to individual metadata entries for each of the project tasks for more information.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:otherConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:otherConstraints\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/LimitationsOnPublicAccess/noLimitations\"\u003eno limitations\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:otherConstraints\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_LegalConstraints\u003e       \u003c/gmd:resourceConstraints\u003e       \u003cgmd:resourceConstraints\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_LegalConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:useConstraints\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_RestrictionCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_RestrictionCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"otherRestrictions\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:useConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:otherConstraints\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e© DEFRA 2010 NRW have signed a licence with regards to the access and use of this dataset. Parts of the dataset are restricted, please see individual metadata entries for details. Derived data may be used within NRW exclusively within the scope of the aims of the DEFRA project. Derived data (as listed in the licence) may not be used for commercial gain therefore derived layers must not be made available in response to requests by external organisations that may profit from their use.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:otherConstraints\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_LegalConstraints\u003e       \u003c/gmd:resourceConstraints\u003e       \u003cgmd:spatialRepresentationType\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_SpatialRepresentationTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_SpatialRepresentationTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"vector\" /\u003e  