andards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"wel\"\u003ewel\u003c/gmd:LanguageCode\u003e       \u003c/gmd:languageCode\u003e       \u003cgmd:characterEncoding /\u003e     \u003c/gmd:PT_Locale\u003e   \u003c/gmd:locale\u003e   \u003cgmd:locale\u003e     \u003cgmd:PT_Locale id\u003d\"EN\"\u003e       \u003cgmd:languageCode\u003e         \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:languageCode\u003e       \u003cgmd:characterEncoding\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_CharacterSetCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_CharacterSetCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"utf8\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:characterEncoding\u003e     \u003c/gmd:PT_Locale\u003e   \u003c/gmd:locale\u003e   \u003cgmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e       \u003cgmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e         \u003cgmd:RS_Identifier\u003e           \u003cgmd:code\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"\"\u003eNONE\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:code\u003e         \u003c/gmd:RS_Identifier\u003e       \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e   \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:identificationInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e       \u003cgmd:citation\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e           \u003cgmd:title xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eBritish Geological Survey (BGS): Maps and Memoirs (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eBritish Geological Survey (BGS): Maps and Memoirs (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:title\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eMapiau ac astudiaethau Arolwg Daearegol Prydain\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003cgmd:code\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eEXT_DS112485\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:code\u003e             \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e           \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e       \u003c/gmd:citation\u003e       \u003cgmd:abstract xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThe British Geological Survey (BGS) maps and memoirs are the principal geological data sources in Britain. Traditionally the 1:50,000 maps have been accompanied by explanatory volumes called Memoirs however now maps are often published with less comprehensive sets of explanatory notes.   Natural Resources Wales (NRW) holds a basic digital GIS layer of BGS geological data at 1:250,000 scale and selected memoirs and reports are held by NRW libraries.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eThe British Geological Survey (BGS) maps and memoirs are the principal geological data sources in Britain. Traditionally the 1:50,000 maps have been accompanied by explanatory volumes called Memoirs however now maps are often published with less comprehensive sets of explanatory notes.   Natural Resources Wales (NRW) holds a basic digital GIS layer of BGS geological data at 1:250,000 scale and selected memoirs and reports are held by NRW libraries.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e         \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e       \u003c/gmd:abstract\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e  