     \u003c/gmd:geographicIdentifier\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_GeographicDescription\u003e           \u003c/gmd:geographicElement\u003e           \u003cgmd:geographicElement\u003e             \u003cgmd:EX_GeographicDescription\u003e               \u003cgmd:geographicIdentifier\u003e                 \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e                   \u003cgmd:code\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eWales (WLS)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:code\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003c/gmd:geographicIdentifier\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_GeographicDescription\u003e           \u003c/gmd:geographicElement\u003e           \u003cgmd:geographicElement\u003e             \u003cgmd:EX_GeographicBoundingBox\u003e               \u003cgmd:westBoundLongitude\u003e                 \u003cgco:Decimal\u003e-5.777741\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:westBoundLongitude\u003e               \u003cgmd:eastBoundLongitude\u003e                 \u003cgco:Decimal\u003e-2.608865\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:eastBoundLongitude\u003e               \u003cgmd:southBoundLatitude\u003e                 \u003cgco:Decimal\u003e51.240829\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:southBoundLatitude\u003e               \u003cgmd:northBoundLatitude\u003e                 \u003cgco:Decimal\u003e53.512067\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:northBoundLatitude\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_GeographicBoundingBox\u003e           \u003c/gmd:geographicElement\u003e           \u003cgmd:temporalElement\u003e             \u003cgmd:EX_TemporalExtent\u003e               \u003cgmd:extent\u003e                 \u003cgml:TimePeriod gml:id\u003d\"_aee16270-1bf2-4e73-b4cb-85e9b706a315\"\u003e                   \u003cgml:beginPosition\u003e2001-05-01\u003c/gml:beginPosition\u003e                   \u003cgml:endPosition\u003e2001-12-01\u003c/gml:endPosition\u003e                 \u003c/gml:TimePeriod\u003e               \u003c/gmd:extent\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_TemporalExtent\u003e           \u003c/gmd:temporalElement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:EX_Extent\u003e       \u003c/gmd:extent\u003e       \u003cgmd:supplementalInformation\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eSurveys conducted by Paul Collins were used in a MSC Thesis in 2001: A quantitative survey of the associated flora and fauna of Sabellaria alveolata (L.) reefs at Criccieth, North Wales - MSc Thesis - University of Wales, Bangor, 2001\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e       \u003c/gmd:supplementalInformation\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e   \u003c/gmd:identificationInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:contentInfo\u003e     \u003cnrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e       \u003cnrw:internalInfo\u003e         \u003cnrw:MD_InternalInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eArchived as Project 284, Media 1110.  Species data is held in Marine Recorder [MRCCW30000000039]\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalContactInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eGIS Service Desk  Subtidal Team Leader, MFSG, NRW\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalContactInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:relatedTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eA quantitative survey of the associated flora and fauna of sabellaria alveolata (L.) reefs at Criccieth, North Wales\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:relatedTitle\u003e         \u003c/nrw:MD_InternalInfo\u003e       \u003c/nrw:internalInfo\u003e     \u003c/nrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e   \u003c/gmd:contentInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:distributionInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_Distribution\u003e       \u003cgmd:distributionFormat\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_Format\u003e           \u003cgmd:name\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/M01/current/DOC\"\u003eDocuments\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:name\u003e           \u003cgmd:version gco:nilReason\u003d\"unknown\" /\u003e           \u003cgmd:specification\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e[A]  Paper and electronic copy of report.   [B]  Species data is held in Marine Recorder [MRCCW30000000039].  [C]  Data is held within Excel Spreadsheets and .MPJ Files, and photos as .jpeg\u0027s of the survey site.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_Format\u003e       \u003c/gmd:distributionFormat\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_Distribution\u003e   \u003c/gmd:distributionInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e       \u003cgmd:scope\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_Scope\u003e           \u003cgmd:level\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:level\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_Scope\u003e       \u003c/gmd:scope\u003e       \u003cgmd:report\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e           \u003cgmd:result\u003e             \u003cgmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e               \u003cgmd:specification\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e                   \u003cgmd:title\u003e                     \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2010/1089\"\u003eCommission Regulation (EU) No 1089/2010 of 23 November 2010 implementing Directive 2007/2/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council as regards interoperability of spatial data sets and services\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:title\u003e                   \u003cgmd:date\u003e                     \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:date\u003e                         \u003cgco:Date\u003e2010-12-08\u003c/gco:Date\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                         \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e                     \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e               \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e               \u003cgmd:explanation\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis dataset has not been assessed for conformance to the referenced INSPIRE regulation.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:explanation\u003e               \u003cgmd:pass\u003e                 \u003cgco:Boolean\u003efalse\u003c/gco:Boolean\u003e               \u003c/gmd:pass\u003e             \u003c/gmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e           \u003c/gmd:result\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e       \u003c/gmd:report\u003e       \u003cgmd:lineage\u003e         \u003cgmd:LI_Lineage\u003e           \u003cgmd:statement xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThe faunal and floral communities associated with intertidal Sabellaria alveolata reefs at Criccieth, North Wales were examined using a number of core and quadrat samples. A small 10 cm x 10 cm quadrat was used for sampling the epifaunal / floral community due to extreme patchiness of areas of different reef-conditions.  A total of 400 quadrats were sampled between the 24 - 29/6/2001, 40 quadrats for each of the habitats stated previously.  To avoid re-sampling a particular reef area survey was conducted while moving along the shore from east to west.  Where particular reef-conditions were abundant at the shore-height being surveyed, quadrats were thrown randomly toward the said area of reef.  For less abundant reef-conditions, patches were surveyed in their entirety placing quadrats over the whole area until the desired quantity had been surveyed. The position of site is incorrect in thesis - position extrapolated from map in thesis and changed by KR 15Feb05. The project carried out at University of Bangor with supervision from Countryside Council for Wales (CCW).\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eThe faunal and floral communities associated with intertidal Sabellaria alveolata reefs at Criccieth, North Wales were examined using a number of core and quadrat samples. A small 10 cm x 10 cm quadrat was used for sampling the epifaunal / floral community due to extreme patchiness of areas of different reef-conditions.  A total of 400 quadrats were sampled between the 24 - 29/6/2001, 40 quadrats for each of the habitats stated previously.  To avoid re-sampling a particular reef area survey was conducted while moving along the shore from east to west.  Where particular reef-conditions were abundant at the shore-height being surveyed, quadrats were thrown randomly toward the said area of reef.  For less abundant reef-conditions, patches were surveyed in their entirety placing quadrats over the whole area until the desired quantity had been surveyed. The position of site is incorrect in thesis - position extrapolated from map in thesis and changed by KR 15Feb05. The project carried out at University of Bangor with supervision from Countryside Council for Wales (CCW).\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:statement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:LI_Lineage\u003e       \u003c/gmd:lineage\u003e     \u003c/gmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e   \u003c/gmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e \u003c/gmd:MD_Metadata\u003e\tUnknown\tNon-editable\t2025-02-04T12:05:01.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\tMEDIN\tPublic record\n17095\tEXT_DS113077\