o\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis dataset is currently managed and supplied by RSWT (hosted by Hampshire and Isle of Wight Wildlife Trust) on behalf of the Environment Agency. NRW hold this data currently on the M Drive: M:\\GIS_Data\\Live\\Biological\\Species\\all_wales\\Terrestrial\\Mammals\\Water_Voles\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalContactInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eGIS Service Desk  External Contact: Helen Perkins, Water for Wildlife Project (Royal Society of Wildlife Trusts)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalContactInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:relatedTitle gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e           \u003c/nrw:relatedTitle\u003e         \u003c/nrw:MD_InternalInfo\u003e       \u003c/nrw:internalInfo\u003e     \u003c/nrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e   \u003c/gmd:contentInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:distributionInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_Distribution\u003e       \u003cgmd:distributionFormat\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_Format\u003e           \u003cgmd:name\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/M01/current/GIS\"\u003eGeographic Information System\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:name\u003e           \u003cgmd:version gco:nilReason\u003d\"unknown\" /\u003e           \u003cgmd:specification\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eESRI shape files and MapInfo .TAB files with supporting information in .doc and .pdf format.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_Format\u003e       \u003c/gmd:distributionFormat\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_Distribution\u003e   \u003c/gmd:distributionInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e       \u003cgmd:scope\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_Scope\u003e           \u003cgmd:level\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:level\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_Scope\u003e       \u003c/gmd:scope\u003e       \u003cgmd:report\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e           \u003cgmd:result\u003e             \u003cgmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e               \u003cgmd:specification\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e                   \u003cgmd:title\u003e                     \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2010/1089\"\u003eCommission Regulation (EU) No 1089/2010 of 23 November 2010 implementing Directive 2007/2/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council as regards interoperability of spatial data sets and services\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:title\u003e                   \u003cgmd:date\u003e                     \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:date\u003e                         \u003cgco:Date\u003e2010-12-08\u003c/gco:Date\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                         \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e                     \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e               \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e               \u003cgmd:explanation\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis dataset has not been assessed for conformance to the referenced INSPIRE regulation.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:explanation\u003e               \u003cgmd:pass\u003e                 \u003cgco:Boolean\u003efalse\u003c/gco:Boolean\u003e               \u003c/gmd:pass\u003e             \u003c/gmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e           \u003c/gmd:result\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e       \u003c/gmd:report\u003e       \u003cgmd:lineage\u003e         \u003cgmd:LI_Lineage\u003e           \u003cgmd:statement xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eIn 2008, the project requested water vole and American mink data for all years from Local Record Centres, Wildlife Trusts and other data suppliers. Data suppliers were asked to provide data in an Excel spreadsheet. These were collated and mapped. This dataset is currently managed and supplied by RSWT (hosted by Hampshire and Isle of Wight Wildlife Trust) on behalf of the Environment Agency.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eIn 2008, the project requested water vole and American mink data for all years from Local Record Centres, Wildlife Trusts and other data suppliers. Data suppliers were asked to provide data in an Excel spreadsheet. These were collated and mapped. This dataset is currently managed and supplied by RSWT (hosted by Hampshire and Isle of Wight Wildlife Trust) on behalf of the Environment Agency.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:statement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:LI_Lineage\u003e       \u003c/gmd:lineage\u003e     \u003c/gmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e   \u003c/gmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e \u003c/gmd:MD_Metadata\u003e\tUnknown\tEditable\t2025-02-04T12:17:38.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n17086\tEXT_DS114814\tLuftwaffe Aerial Photographs for Anglesey (3rd Party Data)\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313134383134\tPrints are held in the aerial photo archive in North Region (Mike Willis room).   Negatives are held in the samples fridge in MYF Labroratory.   A crude CCW produced flight diagram is available on MapInfo.\tGIS Service Desk Sally Ellis, Conservation Officer, North West Wales Sites Team, NRW\t\u003cgmd:MD_Metadata xmlns:gmd\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmd\" xmlns:xsi\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xmlns:gco\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gco\" xmlns:srv\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/srv\" xmlns:gmx\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmx\" xmlns:gts\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gts\" xmlns:gsr\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gsr\" xmlns:gmi\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmi\" xmlns:gss\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gss\" xmlns:nrw\u003d\"http://naturalresources.wales/nrw\" xmlns:gml\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/gml/3.2\" xmlns:xlink\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"\u003e   \u003cgmd:fileIdentifier\u003e     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313134383134\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e   \u003c/gmd:fileIdentifier\u003e   \u003cgmd:language\u003e     \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\"\u003eEnglish\u003c/gmd:LanguageCode\u003e   \u003c/gmd:language\u003e   \u003cgmd:hierarchyLevel\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e   \u003c/gmd:hierarchyLevel\u003e   \u003cgmd:contact\u003e     \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e       \u003cgmd:organisationName gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e       \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e           \u003cgmd:address\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e               \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e          