hoto archive in North Region (Mike Willis room).   Negatives are held in the samples fridge in MYF Labroratory.   A crude CCW produced flight diagram is available on MapInfo.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalContactInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eGIS Service Desk Sally Ellis, Conservation Officer, North West Wales Sites Team, NRW\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalContactInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:relatedTitle gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e           \u003c/nrw:relatedTitle\u003e         \u003c/nrw:MD_InternalInfo\u003e       \u003c/nrw:internalInfo\u003e     \u003c/nrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e   \u003c/gmd:contentInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:distributionInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_Distribution\u003e       \u003cgmd:distributionFormat\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_Format\u003e           \u003cgmd:name\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/M01/current/IMG\"\u003eImage\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:name\u003e           \u003cgmd:version gco:nilReason\u003d\"unknown\" /\u003e           \u003cgmd:specification\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eAvailable as photographic prints and negatives.   A crude flight diagram is also available in MapInfo .tab format\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_Format\u003e       \u003c/gmd:distributionFormat\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_Distribution\u003e   \u003c/gmd:distributionInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e       \u003cgmd:scope\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_Scope\u003e           \u003cgmd:level\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:level\u003e 