e         \u003cgmd:LI_Lineage\u003e           \u003cgmd:statement xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eCamera and aeroplane. The original negatives were lost during the war.  Photographic copies of these have been produced by the National Archives and Records Administration (NARA) in Maryland, USA.  CCW purchased a copy of the prints and negatives for use at CCW. Full coverage is not available and is concentrated on the coast from Holyhead, down the West coast (excluding Newborough) and through the Menai Strait to Red Wharf Bay.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eCamera and aeroplane. The original negatives were lost during the war.  Photographic copies of these have been produced by the National Archives and Records Administration (NARA) in Maryland, USA.  CCW purchased a copy of the prints and negatives for use at CCW. Full coverage is not available and is concentrated on the coast from Holyhead, down the West coast (excluding Newborough) and through the Menai Strait to Red Wharf Bay.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:statement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:LI_Lineage\u003e       \u003c/gmd:lineage\u003e     \u003c/gmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e   \u003c/gmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e \u003c/gmd:MD_Metadata\u003e\tUnknown\tEditable\t2025-02-04T12:24:06.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n17090\tEXT_DS114820\tUK Centre for Ecology and Hydrology (UKCEH): Land Cover Map 2000 and 2007 (3rd Party Data)\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313134383230\tX:\\Physical\\Landcover Map\\Landcover Map 2000.lyr  X:\\Physical\\Landcover Map\\Landcover Map 2007.lyr    Used to be in: Legacy CCW Archive M:\\GIS_Data\\Live\\Physical\\Land_Cover_Map_2007\\\tGIS Service Desk Subject