th Coast of Wales (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eIMAGIN Acoustic Multibeam Survey of the North Coast of Wales (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:title\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eIMAGIN multibeam data - N Wales area\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eIMAGIN prosiect data aml-donfedd - gogledd Cymru\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e2008-12-31\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003cgmd:code\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eEXT_DS114950\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:code\u003e             \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e           \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e       \u003c/gmd:citation\u003e       \u003cgmd:abstract xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eMultibeam data for the North Wales part of the Irish Sea Marine Aggregates Initiative (IMAGIN) project. This includes GeoTiffs (Black and white), navigation data from the vessel and raw data in CARIS HIPS format. Collect multibeam data to support the IMAGIN project (Geological appraisal of marine aggregate resources in the Southern Irish Sea).\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eMultibeam data for the North Wales part of the Irish Sea Marine Aggregates Initiative (IMAGIN) project. This includes GeoTiffs (Black and white), navigation data from the vessel and raw data in CARIS HIPS format. Collect multibeam data to support the IMAGIN project (Geological appraisal of marine aggregate resources in the Southern Irish Sea).\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e         \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e       \u003c/gmd:abstract\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e           \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eMarine Institute\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e           \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e               \u003cgmd:address\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e                   \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eMarine Institute Headquaters, Rinville, Oranmore, Co. Galway, Ireland\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                   \u003cgmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003einstitute.mail@marine.ie\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Address\u003e               \u003c/gmd:address\u003e               \u003cgmd:onlineResource\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e                