          \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eArchived as Project 312, Media 1235.   Reports available online through http://imagin.ucc.ie.   Master copy of data stored by the IMAGIN project and available on the IMAGIN website.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalContactInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eGIS Service Desk  Marine Mapping Scientist, NRW\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalContactInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:relatedTitle gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e           \u003c/nrw:relatedTitle\u003e         \u003c/nrw:MD_InternalInfo\u003e       \u003c/nrw:internalInfo\u003e     \u003c/nrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e   \u003c/gmd:contentInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:distributionInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_Distribution\u003e       \u003cgmd:distributionFormat\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_Format\u003e           \u003cgmd:name\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/M01/current/DOC\"\u003eDocuments\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:name\u003e           \u003cgmd:version gco:nilReason\u003d\"unknown\" /\u003e           \u003cgmd:specification\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e[A] GeoTiffs (b/w) [B] Navigational data from the vessel [C] Raw data in CARIS \u0026amp; HIPS format [D] Report in pdf format (in Ffynnon) and available to download  http://imagin.ucc.ie\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_Format\u003e       \u003c/gmd:distributionFormat\u003e       \u003cgmd:transferOptions\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_DigitalTransferOptions\u003e           \u003cgmd:onLine\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e               \u003cgmd:linkage\u003e                 \u003cgmd:URL\u003ehttp://imagin.ucc.ie/\u003c/gmd:URL\u003e               \u003c/gmd:linkage\u003e               \u003cgmd:n