       \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:languageCode\u003e       \u003cgmd:characterEncoding\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_CharacterSetCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_CharacterSetCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"utf8\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:characterEncoding\u003e     \u003c/gmd:PT_Locale\u003e   \u003c/gmd:locale\u003e   \u003cgmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e       \u003cgmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e         \u003cgmd:RS_Identifier\u003e           \u003cgmd:code\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/4326\"\u003eLatitude and Longitude (EPSG::4326)\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:code\u003e         \u003c/gmd:RS_Identifier\u003e       \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e   \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:identificationInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e       \u003cgmd:citation\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e           \u003cgmd:title xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eBangor University Acoustic Multibeam Echosounder Survey of the North Llyn Modiolus Bed 2008 (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eBangor University Acoustic Multibeam Echosounder Survey of the North Llyn Modiolus Bed 2008 (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:title\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eData ecoseinydd amlbaladr gwely modiolus Gogledd Llyn 2008\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eNorth Llyn modiolus bed multibeam echosounder data 2008\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e2012-07-06\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003cgmd:code\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eEXT_DS114968\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:code\u003e             \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e           \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e       \u003c/gmd:citation\u003e       \u003cgmd:abstract xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis is a multibeam echosounder (MBES) dataset covering the extent of the original horse mussel (Modiolus modiolus) bed off the north coast of the Llyn Peninsular, just west of Porth Dinllaen. The area surveyed is approximately 13 km long and 4 km wide.  Additional boat time between British Geological Survey (BGS) surveys was utilised to provide coverage of the North Llyn Modiolus bed. The dataset has been subsequently used by former Countryside Council for Wales (CCW), now Natural Resources Wales (NRW) for modiolus monitoring work; and, by Bangor University for teaching and Master of Science (MSc) project work.  The confidence in this dataset is high. The data has been tidally corrected although a couple of small gaps exist.  It is not clear whether the data meets International Hydrographic Organisation (IHO) order 1 standards.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eThis is a multibeam echosounder (MBES) dataset covering the extent of the original horse mussel (Modiolus modiolus) bed off the north coast of the Llyn Peninsular, just west of Porth Dinllaen. The area surveyed is approximately 13 km long and 4 km wide.  Additional boat time between British Geological Survey (BGS) surveys was utilised to provide coverage of the North Llyn Modiolus bed. The dataset has been subsequently used by former Countryside Council for Wales (CCW), now Natural Resources Wales (NRW) for modiolus monitoring work; and, by Bangor University for teaching and Master of Science (MSc) project work.  The confidence in this dataset is high. The data has been tidally corrected although a couple of small gaps exist.  It is not clear whether the data meets International Hydrographic Organisation (IHO) order 1 standards.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e         \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e       \u003c/gmd:abstract\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e           \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eUniversity of Wales, Bangor. School of Ocean Sciences\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e           \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e               \u003cgmd:address\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e                   \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eBangor, Gwynedd, LL57 2DG\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e           