          \u003c/gmd:accessConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:otherConstraints\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis dataset is wholly owned by Bangor University (School of Ocean Sciences).  NRW may provide access to this dataset on request in some circumstances.  However, enquirers are advised to obtain a copy from the owner/originator directly, rather than NRW. NRW may NOT publish or disseminate it in its entirety.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:otherConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:otherConstraints\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/LimitationsOnPublicAccess/noLimitations\"\u003eno limitations\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:otherConstraints\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_LegalConstraints\u003e       \u003c/gmd:resourceConstraints\u003e       \u003cgmd:resourceConstraints\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_LegalConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:useConstraints\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_RestrictionCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_RestrictionCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"otherRestrictions\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:useConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:otherConstraints\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e© Bangor University 2012. NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to re-use or disseminate this dataset. Those seeking such permission should approach the originator directly.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:otherConstraints\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_LegalConstraints\u003e       \u003c/gmd:resourceConstraints\u003e       \u003cgmd:spatialRepresentationType\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_SpatialRepresentationTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_SpatialRepresentationTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"vector\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:spatialRepresentationType\u003e       \u003cgmd:language\u003e         \u