ces/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"revision\" /\u003e                           \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e                         \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                     \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:authority\u003e                   \u003cgmd:code\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003ebenthic boundary layer\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:code\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003c/gmd:geographicIdentifier\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_GeographicDescription\u003e           \u003c/gmd:geographicElement\u003e           \u003cgmd:geographicElement\u003e             \u003cgmd:EX_GeographicDescription\u003e               \u003cgmd:geographicIdentifier\u003e                 \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e                   \u003cgmd:code\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eGWYNEDD - GWYNEDD\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:code\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003c/gmd:geographicIdentifier\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_GeographicDescription\u003e           \u003c/gmd:geographicElement\u003e           \u003cgmd:geographicElement\u003e             \u003cgmd:EX_GeographicBoundingBox\u003e               \u003cgmd:westBoundLongitude\u003e                 \u003cgco:Decimal\u003e-4.701983\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:westBoundLongitude\u003e               \u003cgmd:eastBoundLongitude\u003e                 \u003cgco:Decimal\u003e-4.59252\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:eastBoundLongitude\u003e               \u003cgmd:southBoundLatitude\u003e                 \u003cgco:Decimal\u003e52.896155\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:southBoundLatitude\u003e               \u003cgmd:northBoundLatitude\u003e                 \u003cgco:Decimal\u003e52.970441\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:northBoundLatitude\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_GeographicBoundingBox\u003e           \u003c/gmd:geographicElement\u003e           \u003cgmd:temporalElement\u003e             \u003cgmd:EX_TemporalExtent\u003e               \u003cgmd:extent\u003e                 \u003cgml:TimePeriod gml:id\u003d\"_51a44b8f-b6ed-478c-8a91-c1d3652ee3b4\"\u003e                   \u003cgml:beginPosition\u003e2008-05-10\u003c/gml:beginPosition\u003e                   \u003cgml:endPosition\u003e2008-05-10\u003c/gml:endPosition\u003e                 \u003c/gml:TimePeriod\u003e               \u003c/gmd:extent\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_TemporalExtent\u003e           \u003c/gmd:temporalElement\u003e           \u003cgmd:verticalElement\u003e             \u003cgmd:EX_VerticalExtent\u003e               \u003cgmd:minimumValue\u003e                 \u003cgco:Real\u003e-15m\u003c/gco:Real\u003e               \u003c/gmd:minimumValue\u003e               \u003cgmd:maximumValue\u003e                 \u003cgco:Real\u003e-17m\u003c/gco:Real\u003e               \u003c/gmd:maximumValue\u003e               \u003cgmd:verticalCRS xlink:href\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/5701\" /\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_VerticalExtent\u003e           \u003c/gmd:verticalElement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:EX_Extent\u003e       \u003c/gmd:extent\u003e       \u003cgmd:supplementalInformation\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eAnalysis of the 2008 multibeam data and modiolus extent is written up in \"Gibbs P. E. (2008) Acoustic monitoring of sensitive protected habitats. MSc Applied Marine Geoscience School of Ocean Sciences Bangor University.\"  Data can be compared to the multibeam survey done in 2005 part of which covers the same area as portions of the HABMAP (habitat mapping) project. See page 26 of the MSc report for more details about how the data was tidally corrected.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e       \u003c/gmd:supplementalInformation\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e   \u003c/gmd:identificationInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:contentInfo\u003e     \u003cnrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e       \u003cnrw:internalInfo\u003e         \u003cnrw:MD_InternalInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eArchived as Project 234, Media 1354,1355,1356.   Raw data is stored at the School of Ocean Sciences, Bangor University\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalContactInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eGIS Service Desk  Subtidal Team, MFEG, NRW External Custodian:  Dr. Jim Burnell (Experimental Physicist), Ocean Sciences, Craig Mair Building, Bangor University The data was then processed by Christian Wilson at CEFAS\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalContactInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:relatedTitle gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e           \u003c/nrw:relatedTitle\u003e         \u003c/nrw:MD_InternalInfo\u003e       \u003c/nrw:internalInfo\u003e     \u003c/nrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e   \u003c/gmd:contentInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:distributionInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_Distribution\u003e       \u003cgmd:distributionFormat\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_Format\u003e           \u003cgmd:name\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/M01/current/IMG\"\u003eImage\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:name\u003e           \u003cgmd:version gco:nilReason\u003d\"unknown\" /\u003e           \u003cgmd:specification\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e[A]  Fledermaus .SD file. GeoTiff;  [B]  GIS Mapinfo Layers\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_Format\u003e       \u003c/gmd:distributionFormat\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_Distribution\u003e   \u003c/gmd:distributionInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e       \u003cgmd:scope\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_Scope\u003e           \u003cgmd:level\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:level\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_Scope\u003e       \u003c/gmd:scope\u003e       \u003cgmd:report\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e           \u003cgmd:result\u003e             \u003cgmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e               \u003cgmd:specification\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e                   \u003cgmd:title\u003e                     \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2010/1089\"\u003eCommission Regulation (EU) No 1089/2010 of 23 November 2010 implementing Directive 2007/2/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council as regards interoperability of spatial data sets and services\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:title\u003e                   \u003cgmd:date\u003e                     \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:date\u003e                         \u003cgco:Date\u003e2010-12-08\u003c/gco:Date\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                         \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e                     \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e               \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e               \u003cgmd:explanation\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis dataset has not been assessed for conformance to the referenced INSPIRE regulation.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:explanation\u003e               \u003cgmd:pass\u003e                 \u003cgco:Boolean\u003efalse\u003c/gco:Boolean\u003e               \u003c/gmd:pass\u003e             \u003c/gmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e           \u003c/gmd:result\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e       \u003c/gmd:report\u003e       \u003cgmd:lineage\u003e         \u003cgmd:LI_Lineage\u003e           \u003cgmd:statement xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThe area surveyed extends from Porth Dinllaen in a south-west direction to just west of Porth Ysgaden on the north side of the Llyn Peninsular, north west Wales. The survey data was collected aboard the Bangor University Research Vessel (RV) Prince Madog using the British Geological Survey (BGS)  Kongsburg EM 3002 multibeam system. The data was then processed at the Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science (Cefas) and tidally corrected using the OLEX bathymetric system. A tide gauge was installed close by (at Porth Ysgaden) to provide the data for tidal correction, which was corrected to the Holyhead base station and then to Ordnance Datum Newlyn.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eThe area surveyed extends from Porth Dinllaen in a south-west direction to just west of Porth Ysgaden on the north side of the Llyn Peninsular, north west Wales. The survey data was collected aboard the Bangor University Research Vessel (RV) Prince Madog using the British Geological Survey (BGS)  Kongsburg EM 3002 multibeam system. The data was then processed at the Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science (Cefas) and tidally corrected using the OLEX bathymetric system. A tide gauge was installed close by (at Porth Ysgaden) to provide the data for tidal correction, which was corrected to the Holyhead base station and then to Ordnance Datum Newlyn.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:statement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:LI_Lineage\u003e       \u003c/gmd:lineage\u003e     \u003c/gmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e   \u003c/gmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e \u003c/gmd:MD_Metadata\u003e\tUnknown\tNon-editable\t2025-02-04T12:00:21.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n17081\tEXT_DS114969\tJNCC Acoustic Multibeam Echosounder Survey of Selected Sites off the North Coast of Anglesey as part of the Mapping European Seabed Habitats (MESH) Project (3rd Party Data)\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313134393639\tArchived as Project 179, Media 1357.   Master data is stored at JNCC.    Raw multibeam data is on CD-ROM (OF1001) as is processed multibeam data (OF1049), and in GIS format with other GIS data\tGIS Service Desk Subtidal Team, MFEG, NRW\t\u003cgmd:MD_Metadata xmlns:gmd\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmd\" xmlns:xsi\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xmlns:gco\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gco\" xmlns:srv\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/srv\" xmlns:gmx\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmx\" xmlns:gts\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gts\" xmlns:gsr\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gsr\" xmlns:gmi\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmi\" xmlns:gss\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gss\" xmlns:nrw\u003d\"http://naturalresources.wales/nrw\" xmlns:gml\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/gml/3.2\" xmlns:xlink\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"\u003e   \u003cgmd:fileIdentifier\u003e     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313134393639\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e   \u003c/gmd:fileIdentifier\u003e   \u003cgmd:language\u003e     \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\"\u003eEnglish\u003c/gmd:LanguageCode\u003e   \u003c/gmd:language\u003e   \u003cgmd:parentIdentifier\u003e     \u003cgco:C