nfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e       \u003cgmd:citation\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e           \u003cgmd:title xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eJNCC Acoustic Multibeam Echosounder Survey of Selected Sites off the North Coast of Anglesey as part of the Mapping European Seabed Habitats (MESH) Project (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eJNCC Acoustic Multibeam Echosounder Survey of Selected Sites off the North Coast of Anglesey as part of the Mapping European Seabed Habitats (MESH) Project (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:title\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eArolwg ecoseinydd amlbaladr acwstig o safleoedd penodol oddi ar arfordir gogledd Ynys Mon fel rhan o\u0027r prosiect Mapio Cynefinoedd Gwelyau Mor Ewrop (MESH)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e2012-07-09\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003cgmd:code\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eEXT_DS114969\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:code\u003e             \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e           \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e       \u003c/gmd:citation\u003e       \u003cgmd:abstract xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eDuring the summer of 2005, JNCC collaborated with partners of the HABMAP project to survey areas of potential Annex 1 habitat (primarily reef) in the Irish Sea. This was to support nature conservation initiatives beyond 12 nm North of Anglesey. This multibeam echosounder survey was carried out alongside single-beam data collection, seabed sampling and towed video imaging. Four areas of seabed covering approximately 140 sq km were surveyed and following data analysis, the area of study was broadly characterised by a complex topography and mixed sediment mosaics. The purpose of this data capture was to obtain MBES coverage of the study areas for further interpretation and analysis in conjunction with other data gathered in the area, for the purpose of identifying Annex 1 subtidal habitats.  Confidence in data is high. Data depth corrected for tide using POLPRED software which utilises one or more of Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory\u0027s hydrodyamic models. CARIS HIPS / SIPS software used to create surfaces and gridded datasets by experienced surveyors.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eDuring the summer of 2005, JNCC collaborated with partners of the HABMAP project to survey areas of potential Annex 1 habitat (primarily reef) in the Irish Sea. This was to support nature conservation initiatives beyond 12 nm North of Anglesey. This multibeam echosounder survey was carried out alongside single-beam data collection, seabed sampling and towed video imaging. Four areas of seabed covering approximately 140 sq km were surveyed and following data analysis, the area of study was broadly characterised by a complex topography and mixed sediment mosaics. The purpose of this data capture was to obtain MBES coverage of the study areas for further interpretation and analysis in conjunction with other data gathered in the area, for the purpose of identifying Annex 1 subtidal habitats.  Confidence in data is high. Data depth corrected for tide using POLPRED software which utilises one or more of Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory\u0027s hydrodyamic models. CARIS HIPS / SIPS software used to create surfaces and gridded datasets by experienced surveyors.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e         \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e       \u003c/gmd:abstract\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e           \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eJoint Nature Conservancy Committee (JNCC)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e           \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e               \u003cgmd:address\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e                   \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eJoint Nature Conservancy Committee (JNCC), Monkstone House, City Road, Peterborough, PE1 1JY\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                   \u003cgmd:electronicMailAddress gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Address\u003e               \u003c/gmd:address\u003e               \u003cgmd:onlineResource\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e                   \u003cgmd:linkage\u003e                     \u003cgmd:URL\u003ehttp://www.jncc.gov.uk\u003c/gmd:URL\u003e                   \u003c/gmd