cgco:CharacterString\u003eArchived as Project 179, Media 1357.   Master data is stored at JNCC.    Raw multibeam data is on CD-ROM (OF1001) as is processed multibeam data (OF1049), and in GIS format with other GIS data\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalContactInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eGIS Service Desk Subtidal Team, MFEG, NRW\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalContactInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:relatedTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eBroad-scale biotope mapping of potential reefs in the Irish sea (north-west of Anglesey)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:relatedTitle\u003e         \u003c/nrw:MD_InternalInfo\u003e       \u003c/nrw:internalInfo\u003e     \u003c/nrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e   \u003c/gmd:contentInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:distributionInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_Distribution\u003e       \u003cgmd:distributionFormat\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_Format\u003e           \u003cgmd:name\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/M01/current/DOC\"\u003eDocuments\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:name\u003e           \u003cgmd:version gco:nilReason\u003d\"unknown\" /\u003e           \u003cgmd:specification\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e[A]  xyz data in .txt and .TAB format [B]  CARIS HIPS raw data format [C]  GeoTiff images\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_Format\u003e       \u003c/gmd:distributionFormat\u003e       \u003cgmd:transferOptions\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_DigitalTransferOptions\u003e           \u003cgmd:onLine\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e               \u003cgmd:linkage\u003e                 \u003cgmd:URL\u003ehttps://data.gov.uk/publisher/joint-nature-conservation-committee\u003c/gmd:URL\u003e               \u003c/gmd:linkage\u003e               \u003cgmd:name\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eView Metadata\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:name\u003e               \u003cgmd:description\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eWorld Wide Web page\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:description\u003e               \u003cgmd:function\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_OnLineFunctionCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_OnLineFunctionCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"information\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:function\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e           \u003c/gmd:onLine\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_DigitalTransferOptions\u003e       \u003c/gmd:transferOptions\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_Distribution\u003e   \u003c/gmd:distributionInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e       \u003cgmd:scope\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_Scope\u003e           \u003cgmd:level\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:level\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_Scope\u003e       \u003c/gmd:scope\u003e       \u003cgmd:report\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e           \u003cgmd:result\u003e             \u003cgmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e               \u003cgmd:specification\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e                   \u003cgmd:title\u003e                     \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2010/1089\"\u003eCommission Regulation (EU) No 1089/2010 of 23 November 2010 implementing Directive 2007/2/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council as regards interoperability of spatial data sets and services\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:title\u003e                   \u003cgmd:date\u003e                     \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:date\u003e                         \u003cgco:Date\u003e2010-12-08\u003c/gco:Date\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                         \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e                     \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e               \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e               \u003cgmd:explanation\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis dataset has not been assessed for conformance to the referenced INSPIRE regulation.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:explanation\u003e               \u003cgmd:pass\u003e                 \u003cgco:Boolean\u003efalse\u003c/gco:Boolean\u003e               \u003c/gmd:pass\u003e             \u003c/gmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e           \u003c/gmd:result\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e       \u003c/gmd:report\u003e       \u003cgmd:lineage\u003e         \u003cgmd:LI_Lineage\u003e           \u003cgmd:statement xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eMultibeam echosounder data acquired using Kongsberg Simrad EM1002 hull mounted on the R/V Celtic voyager. Frequency 93kHz (outer +/- 20 degrees) and 98kHz (inner +/- 50 degree swath centered at Nadir) utilising MERLIN software package. Swath ideally kept at max of 68n degrees to cover approximately 4.7 times water depth. Line spacing approximately 200 m giving 15-20% overlap. Three sound velocity drops made during cruise to calibrate to water conditions. Dataset collected as part of a collaborative cruise with JNCC and the Irish Marine Institute, data for the HABMAP project collected during the same cruise.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eMultibeam echosounder data acquired using Kongsberg Simrad EM1002 hull mounted on the R/V Celtic voyager. Frequency 93kHz (outer +/- 20 degrees) and 98kHz (inner +/- 50 degree swath centered at Nadir) utilising MERLIN software package. Swath ideally kept at max of 68n degrees to cover approximately 4.7 times water depth. Line spacing approximately 200 m giving 15-20% overlap. Three sound velocity drops made during cruise to calibrate to water conditions. Dataset collected as part of a collaborative cruise with JNCC and the Irish Marine Institute, data for the HABMAP project collected during the same cruise.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:statement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:LI_Lineage\u003e       \u003c/gmd:lineage\u003e     \u003c/gmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e   \u003c/gmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e \u003c/gmd:MD_Metadata\u003e\tUnknown\tNon-editable\t2025-02-04T12:36:20.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n17082\tEXT_DS115118\tRSPB Invertebrate and Algae Inventory of the Skerries (2011) (3rd Party Data)\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313135313138\tArchived as Project 349, Media 1326 and 1366.   Species data available through Marine Recorder. We had permission to digitise and enter into Marine Recorder\tGIS Service Desk  Paul Brazier, Intertidal Ecologist, NRW External Contact: David Tompkins, RSPB (The Skerries)\t\u003cgmd:MD_Metadata xmlns:gmd\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmd\" xmlns:xsi\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xmlns:gco\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gco\" xmlns:srv\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/srv\" xmlns:gmx\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmx\" xmlns:gts\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gts\" xmlns:gsr\u003d\"http://