SetCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"utf8\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:characterEncoding\u003e     \u003c/gmd:PT_Locale\u003e   \u003c/gmd:locale\u003e   \u003cgmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e       \u003cgmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e         \u003cgmd:RS_Identifier\u003e           \u003cgmd:code\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/27700\"\u003eBritish National Grid (EPSG::27700)\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:code\u003e         \u003c/gmd:RS_Identifier\u003e       \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e   \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:identificationInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e       \u003cgmd:citation\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e           \u003cgmd:title xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eRSPB Invertebrate and Algae Inventory of the Skerries (2011) (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eRSPB Invertebrate and Algae Inventory of the Skerries (2011) (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:title\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2011 RSPB Skerries intertidal\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e2011 Draft RSPB Invertebrate and Algae inventory of The Skerries  MRCCW31600000005\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eRhestr anifeiliaid di-asgwrn-cefn ac algau Ynysoedd y Moelrhoniaid 2011 y Gymdeithas Frenhinol er Gwarchod Adar\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e2011-12-31\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003cgmd:code\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eEXT_DS115118\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:code\u003e             \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e           \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e       \u003c/gmd:citation\u003e       \u003cgmd:abstract xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThe aim of this data capture was to develop an inventory of species for the Skerries around North Anglesey. Data was supplied to Countryside Council for Wales (CCW) to provide contextual information about seal habitats on the Skerries.  In 2011 the RSPB conducted an intertidal survey of the Skerries, off North Anglesey to create an inventory of species found there. 5 sites were surveyed to represent different intertidal environments with respect to exposure to wave action, silt and sediment level, tidal current exposure and shoreline substrata. At each location the shore was surveyed at high, mid and low tide levels. This provided an inventory of algal species and invertebrate species at the 5 locations recording presence/absence. RSPB have given Natural Resources Wales (NRW) permission to include this data with its own data holdings in Marine Recorder.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eThe aim of this data capture was to develop an inventory of species for the Skerries around North Anglesey. Data was supplied to Countryside Council for Wales (CCW) to provide contextual information about seal habitats on the Skerries.  In 2011 the RSPB conducted an intertidal survey of the Skerries, off North Anglesey to create an inventory of species found there. 5 sites were surveyed to represent different intertidal environments with respect to exposure to wave action, silt and sediment level, tidal current exposure and shoreline substrata. At each location the shore was surveyed at high, mid and low tide levels. This provided an inventory of algal species and invertebrate species at the 5 locations recording presence/absence. RSPB have given Natural Resources Wales (NRW) permission to include this data with its own data holdings in Marine Recorder.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e         \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e       \u003c/gmd:abstract\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e           \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eRoyal Society for the Protection of Birds (RSPB)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e           \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e               \u003cgmd:address\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e                   \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eSutherland House, Cowbridge Road East, Cardiff, CF11 9AB\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                   \u003cgmd:electronicMailAddress\u00