e\t2025-02-04T12:00:49.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\tMEDIN\tPublic record\n17083\tEXT_DS115163\tEIRGrid plc East West Interconnector Project in the Irish Sea (3rd Party Data)\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313135313633\tArchived as Project 374, Media 1384 (File path: K:\\Archive\\Media 1301to1400\\Media 1384)  [A] Reports and appendices in .pdf format [B] Report Images/charts for each of the above [C] GIS data in ArcView and for use with ERMapper. Include habitat data (grab Photo locations, contours, seabed photo locations, side Scan locations, Video footage locations) [D] SideScan images in GeoTiff format [E] Source data.  unprocessed XYZ data for Bathymetry and sidescan data. [F] Processed gridded xyz data in tiff form [G] Images of sediment grabs and seabed [H] Video data in .VOB format (for use with DVD) [I] Supporting information as txt and pdf files.  Information about data and permissions for use\tInternal Custodian: Kirsten Ramsay, Team Leader, Marine \u0026amp; Coastal Ecosystems Team GIS Service Desk  External Custodian: EirGrid Plc\t\u003cgmd:MD_Metadata xmlns:gmd\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmd\" xmlns:xsi\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xmlns:gco\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gco\" xmlns:srv\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/srv\" xmlns:gmx\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmx\" xmlns:gts\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gts\" xmlns:gsr\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gsr\" xmlns:gmi\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmi\" xmlns:gss\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gss\" xmlns:nrw\u003d\"http://naturalresources.wales/nrw\" xmlns:gml\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/gml/3.2\" xmlns:xlink\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"\u003e   \u003cgmd:fileIdentifier\u003e     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313135313633\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e   \u003c/gmd:fileIdentifier\u003e   \u003cgmd:language\u003e     \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeLi