3e     \u003cgmd:PT_Locale id\u003d\"EN\"\u003e       \u003cgmd:languageCode\u003e         \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:languageCode\u003e       \u003cgmd:characterEncoding\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_CharacterSetCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_CharacterSetCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"utf8\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:characterEncoding\u003e     \u003c/gmd:PT_Locale\u003e   \u003c/gmd:locale\u003e   \u003cgmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e       \u003cgmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e         \u003cgmd:RS_Identifier\u003e           \u003cgmd:code\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/4326\"\u003eLatitude and Longitude (EPSG::4326)\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:code\u003e         \u003c/gmd:RS_Identifier\u003e       \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e   \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:identificationInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e       \u003cgmd:citation\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e           \u003cgmd:title xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eJNCC Acoustic Multibeam Echosounder Survey of two sites off North West Anglesey 2009 (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eJNCC Acoustic Multibeam Echosounder Survey of two sites off North West Anglesey 2009 (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:title\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eArolwg ecoseinydd amlbaladr acwstig gan y Cydbwyllgor Gwarchod Natur (JNCC) o ddau safle oddi ar Ogledd Orllewin Ynys Mon, 2009\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e2012-07-18\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003cgmd:code\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eEXT_DS115167\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:code\u003e             \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e           \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e       \u003c/gmd:citation\u003e       \u003cgmd:abstract xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eIn summer 2009, JNCC commissioned Cefas to carry out a multibeam echosounder survey within two Areas of Search (AoS) for offshore Special Areas of Conservation (SACs) off the North West coast of Anglesey. These areas were selected by JNCC as historic data and evidence suggested that Modiolus modiolus beds, (a subtype of Annex I reef), had been recorded within these areas. The purpose of this data capture was to obtain multibeam (MBES) coverage of two areas of search, in order to carry out seabed interpretation and identify potential drop-camera locations for possible Modiolus modiolus biogenic reef presence. The interpretation of these data was to be used to identify potential drop-camera locations.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eIn summer 2009, JNCC commissioned Cefas to carry out a multibeam echosounder survey within two Areas of Search (AoS) for offshore Special Areas of Conservation (SACs) off the North West coast of Anglesey. These areas were selected by JNCC as historic data and evidence suggested that Modiolus modiolus beds, (a subtype of Annex I reef), had been recorded within these areas. The purpose of this data capture was to obtain multibeam (MBES) coverage of two areas of search, in order to carry out seabed interpretation and identify potential drop-camera locations for possible Modiolus modiolus biogenic reef presence. The interpretation of these data was to be used to identify potential drop-camera locations.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e         \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e       \u003c/gmd:abstract\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e           \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eJoint Nature Conservancy Committee (JNCC)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e           \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e               \u003cgmd:address\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e                   \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eJoint Nature Conservancy Committee (JNCC), Monkstone House, City Road, Peterborough, PE1 1JY\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                   \u003cgmd:electronicMailAddress gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Address\u003e               \u003c/gmd:address\u003e              