:37:47.919Z\u003c/gco:DateTime\u003e   \u003c/gmd:dateStamp\u003e   \u003cgmd:metadataStandardName\u003e     \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/M25/current/NRW/\"\u003eNRW\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e   \u003c/gmd:metadataStandardName\u003e   \u003cgmd:metadataStandardVersion\u003e     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e1.0\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e   \u003c/gmd:metadataStandardVersion\u003e   \u003cgmd:locale\u003e     \u003cgmd:PT_Locale id\u003d\"CY\"\u003e       \u003cgmd:languageCode\u003e         \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"wel\"\u003ewel\u003c/gmd:LanguageCode\u003e       \u003c/gmd:languageCode\u003e       \u003cgmd:characterEncoding /\u003e     \u003c/gmd:PT_Locale\u003e   \u003c/gmd:locale\u003e   \u003cgmd:locale\u003e     \u003cgmd:PT_Locale id\u003d\"EN\"\u003e       \u003cgmd:languageCode\u003e         \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:languageCode\u003e       \u003cgmd:characterEncoding\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_CharacterSetCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_CharacterSetCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"utf8\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:characterEncoding\u003e     \u003c/gmd:PT_Locale\u003e   \u003c/gmd:locale\u003e   \u003cgmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e       \u003cgmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e         \u003cgmd:RS_Identifier\u003e           \u003cgmd:code\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/27700\"\u003eBritish National Grid (EPSG::27700)\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:code\u003e         \u003c/gmd:RS_Identifier\u003e       \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e   \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:identificationInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e       \u003cgmd:citation\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e           \u003cgmd:title xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eSwansea Bay Tidal Lagoon Geophysical Investigation (February 2012) (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eSwansea Bay Tidal Lagoon Geophysical Investigation (February 2012) (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:title\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eYmchwiliad geoffisegol i lagwn y llanw ym Mae Abertawe, Chwefror 2012\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e2012-02-28\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003cgmd:code\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eEXT_DS115179\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:code\u003e             \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e           \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e       \u003c/gmd:citation\u003e       \u003cgmd:abstract xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eA hydrographic and geophysical survey of the proposed Swansea tidal lagoon in Swansea Bay was carried out by Titan Environmental Surveys Ltd in the winter of 2011/12. This included singlebeam echosounder, sidescan sonar, surface tow boomer and magnetometer surveys. All data were referenced to OSGB36 datum using OSTN02 datum transformation, and seabed bathymetry was reduced to chart datum using the UKHO Vertical Offshore reference frame (VORF) model. The dataset shows a gently sloping seabed of thin sand and gravels overlying a sequence of fine sediments of up to 20m thickness on top of boulder clay. An outcrop of boulder clay divides the site into E and W zones with featureless smooth sands in the E, and predominantly gravel in the W. No bedforms large enough to produce bathymetric features were identified. The purpose of this data capture was to carry out a hydrographic and geophysical survey of the proposed Swansea Tidal Lagoon site in Swansea Bay.  Data provided to Countryside Council for Wales (CCW) for internal business use only - for consultation on the Swansea Bay Tidal lagoon casework .  Data is considered confidential and may not be disseminated.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eA hydrographic and geophysical survey of the proposed Swansea tidal lagoon in Swansea Bay was carried out by Titan Environmental Surveys Ltd in the winter of 2011/12. This included singlebeam echosounder, sidescan sonar, surface tow boomer and magnetometer surveys. All data were referenced to OSGB36 datum using OSTN02 datum transformation, and seabed bathymetry was reduced to chart datum using the UKHO Vertical Offshore reference frame (VORF) model. The dataset shows a gently sloping seabed of thin sand and gravels overlying a sequence of fine sediments of up to 20m thickness on top of boulder clay. An outcrop of boulder clay divides the site into E and W zones with featureless smooth sands in the E, and predominantly gravel in the W. No bedforms large enough to produce bathymetric features were identified. The purpose of this data capture was to carry out a hydrographic and geophysical survey of the proposed Swansea Tidal Lagoon site in Swansea Bay.  Data provided to Countryside Council for Wales (CCW) for internal business use only - for consultation on the Swansea Bay Tidal lagoon casework .  Data is considered confidential and may not be disseminated.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e         \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e       \u003c/gmd:abstract\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e           \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eTitan Environmental Survey Ltd\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e           \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e               \u003cgmd:address\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e                   \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eTital Environmental Surveys, Orion House, Waterton Industrial Estate, Bridgend, Mid Glamorgan, CF311 3XB, Wales\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                   \u003cgmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003en/a\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Address\u003e               \u003c/gmd:address\u003e               \u003cgmd:onlineResource\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e                   \u003cgmd:linkage\u003e                     \u003cgmd:URL\u003ehttp://www.titansurveys.com/\u003c/gmd:URL\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:linkage\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e       