nternalInfo\u003e       \u003c/nrw:internalInfo\u003e     \u003c/nrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e   \u003c/gmd:contentInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:distributionInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_Distribution\u003e       \u003cgmd:distributionFormat\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_Format\u003e           \u003cgmd:name\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/M01/current/IMG\"\u003eImage\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:name\u003e           \u003cgmd:version gco:nilReason\u003d\"unknown\" /\u003e           \u003cgmd:specification\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eGeotiff image Bathymetry .xyz file Sidescan sonar .xtf .jsf Report .pdf .dwg CAD files of interpreted features from SSS, also CAD bathymetry layer. Geophysical data (boomer, magnetometer) data not supplied.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_Format\u003e       \u003c/gmd:distributionFormat\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_Distribution\u003e   \u003c/gmd:distributionInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e       \u003cgmd:scope\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_Scope\u003e           \u003cgmd:level\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:level\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_Scope\u003e       \u003c/gmd:scope\u003e       \u003cgmd:report\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e           \u003cgmd:result\u003e             \u003cgmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e               \u003cgmd:specification\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e                   \u003cgmd:title\u003e                     \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2010/1089\"\u003eCommission Regulation (EU) No 1089/2010 of 23 November 2010 implementing Directive 2007/2/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council as regards interoperability of spatial data sets and services\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:title\u003e                   \u003cgmd:date\u003e                     \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:date\u003e                         \u003cgco:Date\u003e2010-12-08\u003c/gco:Date\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                         \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e                     \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e               \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e               \u003cgmd:explanation\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis dataset has not been assessed for conformance to the referenced INSPIRE regulation.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:explanation\u003e               \u003cgmd:pass\u003e                 \u003cgco:Boolean\u003efalse\u003c/gco:Boolean\u003e               \u003c/gmd:pass\u003e             \u003c/gmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e           \u003c/gmd:result\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e       \u003c/gmd:report\u003e       \u003cgmd:lineage\u003e         \u003cgmd:LI_Lineage\u003e           \u003cgmd:statement xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eSurvey carried out by Titan Environmental Surveys Ltd on commission from Inazin (formerly Low Carbon Tidal). Data and report provided to CCW by Titan, and marked as confidential. Odom Hydrotrac single beam echosounder at 200KHz and 16/sec sounding rate. Fully corrected using on board motion sensor and VORF models for tidal correction to chart datum. Sidescan sonar data captured using an Edgetech 4200-FS sidescan sonar, recording frequencies at 100 and 400 MHz simultaneously. See report for further information. Survey carried out by professional hydrographers. All data corrected and referenced to OSGB36 datum and chart datum for bathymetry using the UKHO Vertical Offshore Reference Frasme (VORF) model.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eSurvey carried out by Titan Environmental Surveys Ltd on commission from Inazin (formerly Low Carbon Tidal). Data and report provided to CCW by Titan, and marked as confidential. Odom Hydrotrac single beam echosounder at 200KHz and 16/sec sounding rate. Fully corrected using on board motion sensor and VORF models for tidal correction to chart datum. Sidescan sonar data captured using an Edgetech 4200-FS sidescan sonar, recording frequencies at 100 and 400 MHz simultaneously. See report for further information. Survey carried out by professional hydrographers. All data corrected and referenced to OSGB36 datum and chart datum for bathymetry using the UKHO Vertical Offshore Reference Frasme (VORF) model.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:statement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:LI_Lineage\u003e       \u003c/gmd:lineage\u003e     \u003c/gmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e   \u003c/gmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e \u003c/gmd:MD_Metadata\u003e\tUnknown\tNon-editable\t2025-02-04T12:08:58.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n17122\tEXT_DS115256\tRisso\u0027s Dolphin (Grampus griseus) Surveys Conducted in North Wales (2012) (3rd Party Data)\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313135323536\tArchived as Project 390, Media 1406   Excel spreadsheets are stored on the WDC server.\tGIS Service Desk Team Leader Marine Vertebrates, NRW. External Custodian: Sonja Mareike Eisfeld, WDC.         We have listed as not for re-supply externally.  As WG ERF grant, we are only aware of the condition that allows NRW to produce and  publish a NRW Scientific report.  It is not clear if we also have the right to distribute the data.\t\u003cgmd:MD_Metadata xmlns:gmd\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmd\" xmlns:xsi\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xmlns:gco\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gco\" xmlns:srv\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/srv\" xmlns:gmx\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmx\" xmlns:gts\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gts\" xmlns:gsr\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gsr\" xmlns:gmi\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmi\" xmlns:gss\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gss\" xmlns:nrw\u003d\"http://naturalresources.wales/nrw\" xmlns:gml\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/gml/3.2\" xmlns:xlink\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"\u003e   \u003cgmd:fileIdentifier\u003e     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313135323536\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e   \u003c/gmd:fileIdentifier\u003e   \u003cgmd:language\u003e     \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\"\u003eEnglish\u003c/gmd:LanguageCode\u003e   \u003c/gmd:language\u003e   \u003cgmd:hierarchyLevel\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e   \u003c/gmd:hierarchyLevel\u003e   \u003cgmd:contact\u003e     \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e       \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e       \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e       \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e           \u003cgmd:address\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e               \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eMaes-y-Ffynnon, Penrhosgarnedd, Bangor, Gwynedd, LL57 2DW, Wales\u003c/g