seminate it in its entirety.  There are no access restrictions on this data. NRW may release, publish or disseminate it freely.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:otherConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:otherConstraints\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/LimitationsOnPublicAccess/noLimitations\"\u003eno limitations\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:otherConstraints\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_LegalConstraints\u003e       \u003c/gmd:resourceConstraints\u003e       \u003cgmd:resourceConstraints\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_LegalConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:useConstraints\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_RestrictionCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_RestrictionCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"otherRestrictions\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:useConstraints\u003e           \u003cgmd:otherConstraints\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e© Whale and Dolphin Conservation 2012. Data may be re-used under the terms of the Open Government Licence providing it is done so, acknowledging both the source and copyright of the owners. It is the recipient\u0027s responsibility to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:otherConstraints\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_LegalConstraints\u003e       \u003c/gmd:resourceConstraints\u003e       \u003cgmd:spatialRepresentationType\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_SpatialRepresentationTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_SpatialRepresentationTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"vector\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:spatialRepresentationType\u003e       \u003cgmd:language\u003e         \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\"\u003eEnglish\u003c/gmd:LanguageCode\u003e       \u003c/gmd:language\u003e       \u003cgmd:characterSet\u00