          \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003c/gmd:geographicIdentifier\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_GeographicDescription\u003e           \u003c/gmd:geographicElement\u003e           \u003cgmd:geographicElement\u003e             \u003cgmd:EX_GeographicBoundingBox\u003e               \u003cgmd:westBoundLongitude\u003e                 \u003cgco:Decimal\u003e-4.95401164\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:westBoundLongitude\u003e               \u003cgmd:eastBoundLongitude\u003e                 \u003cgco:Decimal\u003e-4.67467103\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:eastBoundLongitude\u003e               \u003cgmd:southBoundLatitude\u003e                 \u003cgco:Decimal\u003e52.65896377\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:southBoundLatitude\u003e               \u003cgmd:northBoundLatitude\u003e                 \u003cgco:Decimal\u003e52.83658288\u003c/gco:Decimal\u003e               \u003c/gmd:northBoundLatitude\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_GeographicBoundingBox\u003e           \u003c/gmd:geographicElement\u003e           \u003cgmd:temporalElement\u003e             \u003cgmd:EX_TemporalExtent\u003e               \u003cgmd:extent\u003e                 \u003cgml:TimePeriod gml:id\u003d\"_87c1d9d3-99a0-4377-beea-80fd3bd15bda\"\u003e                   \u003cgml:beginPosition\u003e2012-08-19\u003c/gml:beginPosition\u003e                   \u003cgml:endPosition\u003e2012-09-19\u003c/gml:endPosition\u003e                 \u003c/gml:TimePeriod\u003e               \u003c/gmd:extent\u003e             \u003c/gmd:EX_TemporalExtent\u003e           \u003c/gmd:temporalElement\u003e         \u003c/gmd:EX_Extent\u003e       \u003c/gmd:extent\u003e       \u003cgmd:supplementalInformation gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:supplementalInformation\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e   \u003c/gmd:identificationInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:contentInfo\u003e     \u003cnrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e       \u003cnrw:internalInfo\u003e         \u003cnrw:MD_InternalInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eArchived as Project 390, Media 1406   Excel spreadsheets are stored on the WDC server.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalLocationInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:internalContactInfo\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eGIS Service Desk Team Leader Marine Vertebrates, NRW. External Custodian: Sonja Mareike Eisfeld, WDC.         We have listed as not for re-supply externally.  As WG ERF grant, we are only aware of the condition that allows NRW to produce and  publish a NRW Scientific report.  It is not clear if we also have the right to distribute the data.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:internalContactInfo\u003e           \u003cnrw:relatedTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eRisso\u0027s dolphins in north Wales\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/nrw:relatedTitle\u003e         \u003c/nrw:MD_InternalInfo\u003e       \u003c/nrw:internalInfo\u003e     \u003c/nrw:MD_ContentInfo\u003e   \u003c/gmd:contentInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:distributionInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_Distribution\u003e       \u003cgmd:distributionFormat\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_Format\u003e           \u003cgmd:name\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/M01/current/IMG\"\u003eImage\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:name\u003e           \u003cgmd:version gco:nilReason\u003d\"unknown\" /\u003e           \u003cgmd:specification\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e[A] Report in pdf and doc workshop [B] A series of images used in the report as jpgs and pdf [C] A series of GIS layers in ArcShp format [D] Excel spreadsheets (not provided)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_Format\u003e       \u003c/gmd:distributionFormat\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_Distribution\u003e   \u003c/gmd:distributionInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:dataQualityInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:DQ_DataQuality\u003e       \u003cgmd:scope\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_Scope\u003e           \u003cgmd:level\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:level\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_Scope\u003e       \u003c/gmd:scope\u003e       \u003cgmd:report\u003e         \u003cgmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e           \u003cgmd:result\u003e             \u003cgmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e               \u003cgmd:specification\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e                   \u003cgmd:title\u003e                     \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2010/1089\"\u003eCommission Regulation (EU) No 1089/2010 of 23 November 2010 implementing Directive 2007/2/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council as regards interoperability of spatial data sets and services\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:title\u003e                   \u003cgmd:date\u003e                     \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:date\u003e                         \u003cgco:Date\u003e2010-12-08\u003c/gco:Date\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                       \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                         \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e                       \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e                     \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:date\u003e                 \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e               \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e               \u003cgmd:explanation\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis dataset has not been assessed for conformance to the referenced INSPIRE regulation.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:explanation\u003e               \u003cgmd:pass\u003e                 \u003cgco:Boolean\u003efalse\u003c/gco:Boolean\u003e               \u003c/gmd:pass\u003e             \u003c/gmd:DQ_ConformanceResult\u003e           \u003c/gmd:result\u003e         \u003c/gmd:DQ_DomainConsistency\u003e       \u003c/gmd:report\u003e       \u003cgmd:lineage\u003e         \u003cgmd:LI_Lineage\u003e           \u003cgmd:statement xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThe methodology consist of a land-based survey from 2 survey sites following a scan-sampling protocol and photo-ID from a small boat. Shore-based surveys were conducted between 19th August and 22nd September 2012.  Boat-based survey were conducted between 2nd September and 22nd September 2012.  The methodology includes step taken to minimize bias and reduce observer fatigue. This grant funded work builds on previous work and is part of a multi-year program of data collection, analysis and policy work.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eThe methodology consist of a land-based survey from 2 survey sites following a scan-sampling protocol and photo-ID from a small boat. Shore-based surveys were conducted between 19th August and 22nd September 2012.  Boat-based survey were conducted between 2nd September and 22nd September 2012.  The methodology includes step taken to minimize bias and reduce observer fatigue. This grant funded work builds on previous work and is part of a multi-year program of data collection, analysis and policy work.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:statement\u003e         \u003c/gm